{"format":1,"seq":728,"writes":[{"type":"document.change","id":2,"content":{"version":3,"kind":"delta","ops":[["p",["generation","message","content"],1,0,[{"type":"text","text":"Expect a choppy few months, with a wider range than usual. The historical matches don't point to a crash before spring. For the S&P they lean slightly lower; for the Nasdaq they lean slightly higher. Starting from Monday's close (S&P 7,422, Nasdaq Composite 24,562), I took the 10 closest 4-year shape matches for each index from separate periods. The S&P was searched back to 1950, the Nasdaq back to 1975.\n\n```mermaid\n%%{init: {\"themeVariables\": {\"xyChart\": {\"plotColorPalette\": \"#3b82f6, #ef4444, #22c55e, #f97316, #a855f7\"}}}}%%\nxychart-beta\n    title \"S&P 500 next 6 months: 10 closest 4-year shape analogs since 1950, rebased to today\"\n    x-axis [\"11-16\", \"​​\", \"​​​\", \"​​​​\", \"​​​​​\", \"12-08\", \"​​​​​​​\", \"​​​​​​​​\", \"​​​​​​​​​\", \"​​​​​​​​​​\", \"12-30\", \"​​​​​​​​​​​​\", \"​​​​​​​​​​​​​\", \"​​​​​​​​​​​​​​\", \"​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​\", \"01-22\", \"​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​\", \"​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​\", \"​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​\", \"​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​\", \"02-12\", \"​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​\", \"​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​\", \"​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​\", \"​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​\", \"03-08\", \"​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​\", \"​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​\", \"​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​\", \"​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​\", \"03-30\", \"​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​\", \"​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​\", \""}]],["a",["generation","message","content",0,"thinkingSignature"],""],["a",["generation","message","content",1,"text"],"​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​\", \"​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​\", \"04-20\", \"​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​\", \"​​​​​​​​​​​"]]}}]}